18
00:00:34,990 --> 00:00:36,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>All of them.</b></font>

19
00:00:36,660 --> 00:00:37,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-I can't look head-on.
-[SERINA] Something wrong?</b></font>

20
00:00:37,660 --> 00:00:39,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hold up.
No swimsuit?</b></font>

21
00:00:40,080 --> 00:00:43,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Even if I had one,
I'd be too nervous to wear it.</b></font>

22
00:00:43,170 --> 00:00:44,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KIYOSHI]
Yep, that tracks.</b></font>

23
00:00:44,500 --> 00:00:45,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Right, Kai?</b></font>

24
00:00:46,550 --> 00:00:47,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hm?</b></font>

25
00:00:47,840 --> 00:00:49,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

26
00:00:49,170 --> 00:00:50,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

27
00:00:52,300 --> 00:00:53,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI]
Why'd you look away?</b></font>

28
00:00:53,430 --> 00:00:54,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Oh, I, uh...</b></font>

29
00:00:55,430 --> 00:00:57,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I just don't know
where to look...</b></font>

30
00:00:58,890 --> 00:01:00,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Right here!</b></font>

31
00:01:00,100 --> 00:01:01,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Okay.</b></font>

32
00:01:01,350 --> 00:01:02,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI]
Come find me in a few.</b></font>

33
00:01:03,360 --> 00:01:04,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Yeah.</b></font>

34
00:01:04,650 --> 00:01:07,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

35
00:01:07,230 --> 00:01:08,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[indistinct chatter]</b></font>

36
00:01:08,780 --> 00:01:10,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
I'm in love with him.</b></font>

37
00:01:10,780 --> 00:01:12,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I can't deny that.</b></font>

38
00:01:12,450 --> 00:01:14,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[waves crashing]</b></font>

39
00:01:14,660 --> 00:01:16,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I have to move forward.</b></font>

40
00:02:49,290 --> 00:02:51,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>SPARKLE 8
SUMMON THE COURAGE</b></font>

41
00:02:51,960 --> 00:02:53,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[cheering]
-[water splashes]</b></font>

42
00:02:53,840 --> 00:02:55,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[laughter]</b></font>

43
00:02:55,510 --> 00:02:57,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

44
00:02:57,300 --> 00:02:58,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hey!</b></font>

45
00:03:00,180 --> 00:03:02,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Ayumi panting]</b></font>

46
00:03:02,680 --> 00:03:03,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Ayumi sighs]</b></font>

47
00:03:04,020 --> 00:03:06,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[AYUMI]
I'm freakin' parched!</b></font>

48
00:03:06,400 --> 00:03:07,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Welcome back.</b></font>

49
00:03:07,850 --> 00:03:09,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hey. Do you guys
wanna get some drinks...</b></font>

50
00:03:09,730 --> 00:03:12,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Ugh. [groans]
-[gasps]</b></font>

51
00:03:12,110 --> 00:03:14,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YURU]
Why's Oguni here, of all days?</b></font>

52
00:03:14,280 --> 00:03:15,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That sucks!</b></font>

53
00:03:15,450 --> 00:03:16,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MIHO]
Yeah.</b></font>

54
00:03:16,700 --> 00:03:18,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>They're glaring daggers.</b></font>

55
00:03:18,410 --> 00:03:21,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

56
00:03:21,200 --> 00:03:23,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We cannot let 'em
mess with Serina.</b></font>

57
00:03:23,500 --> 00:03:24,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You can count on me!</b></font>

58
00:03:24,790 --> 00:03:26,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-You sure?
-Yeah!</b></font>

59
00:03:26,750 --> 00:03:28,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That sounds perfect for you!</b></font>

60
00:03:28,380 --> 00:03:30,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Like you stood up for her
with those other girls.</b></font>

61
00:03:30,750 --> 00:03:32,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The rest of us
will stay out of it.</b></font>

62
00:03:32,800 --> 00:03:34,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI]
You'll stay out of it, too.</b></font>

63
00:03:34,420 --> 00:03:35,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[all gasp]</b></font>

64
00:03:36,050 --> 00:03:37,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'll take care of it.</b></font>

65
00:03:37,680 --> 00:03:38,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's not her business.</b></font>

66
00:03:38,970 --> 00:03:42,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

67
00:03:43,010 --> 00:03:45,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Oh? And who are you
to decide what's her business?</b></font>

68
00:03:45,890 --> 00:03:47,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You're right.
I'm sorry.</b></font>

69
00:03:48,440 --> 00:03:50,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I shouldn't have butted in.</b></font>

70
00:03:50,980 --> 00:03:52,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>In that case,</b></font>

71
00:03:52,440 --> 00:03:54,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm gonna wander around
for a while.</b></font>

72
00:03:54,280 --> 00:03:56,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

73
00:03:56,450 --> 00:03:57,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]
Wait up!</b></font>

74
00:03:58,240 --> 00:03:59,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm scared we'll get separated</b></font>

75
00:03:59,740 --> 00:04:01,620
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>if we don't have a way
to contact you!</b></font>

76
00:04:01,870 --> 00:04:03,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Huh.
-[AYUMI] How about this.</b></font>

77
00:04:03,450 --> 00:04:05,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I can lend you
my phone till you get back!</b></font>

78
00:04:06,500 --> 00:04:08,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Huh? Wait, you actually
have a cell phone?</b></font>

79
00:04:08,960 --> 00:04:10,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[UKA] Mm-hmm.
-[AYUMI] What the...</b></font>

80
00:04:10,540 --> 00:04:12,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>How come you never told me?</b></font>

81
00:04:12,090 --> 00:04:13,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We've gotta trade numbers!</b></font>

82
00:04:13,960 --> 00:04:15,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

83
00:04:15,130 --> 00:04:16,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>AYUMI ENDOU SERINA
KANNO</b></font>

84
00:04:16,670 --> 00:04:17,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[chuckles]</b></font>

85
00:04:18,680 --> 00:04:20,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>All right. I'll go
and put you in my phone</b></font>

86
00:04:20,760 --> 00:04:22,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>as one of my special clubmates.</b></font>

87
00:04:23,350 --> 00:04:24,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You're in a club?</b></font>

88
00:04:24,560 --> 00:04:26,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Uh, the Kai Club.
[chuckles]</b></font>

89
00:04:26,640 --> 00:04:28,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Ugh.
-[AYUMI] With two members?</b></font>

90
00:04:28,520 --> 00:04:30,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SERINA] Yeah!
We sure don't need more.</b></font>

91
00:04:30,980 --> 00:04:33,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA] I'm sorry that
I'm the other member.</b></font>

92
00:04:33,440 --> 00:04:34,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[groans]</b></font>

93
00:04:34,610 --> 00:04:36,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Quit looking so bummed.</b></font>

94
00:04:36,690 --> 00:04:38,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You remember
what I told you before?</b></font>

95
00:04:39,490 --> 00:04:41,490
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Be loud and proud!
-Hm.</b></font>

96
00:04:41,570 --> 00:04:43,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We're loud and we're proud.</b></font>

97
00:04:43,580 --> 00:04:45,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[both chuckle]</b></font>

98
00:04:47,370 --> 00:04:48,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>There!
All good!</b></font>

99
00:04:49,790 --> 00:04:52,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[laughter]</b></font>

100
00:04:53,590 --> 00:04:55,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gulping]</b></font>

101
00:04:56,250 --> 00:04:57,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YASUSHI]
Hey, Kai!</b></font>

102
00:04:57,920 --> 00:04:59,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I heard at the culture festival</b></font>

103
00:04:59,630 --> 00:05:02,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>you touched Ishimori's face
and lovingly stroked it!</b></font>

104
00:05:02,090 --> 00:05:03,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[spits]
[coughs]</b></font>

105
00:05:03,510 --> 00:05:04,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Fess up.
Did that happen?</b></font>

106
00:05:05,970 --> 00:05:07,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI]
There was no stroking.</b></font>

107
00:05:07,890 --> 00:05:09,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KIYOSHI]
Okay. But why her?</b></font>

108
00:05:09,730 --> 00:05:11,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Aren't you only
caretaking during school?</b></font>

109
00:05:11,770 --> 00:05:12,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm doing what, now?</b></font>

110
00:05:13,020 --> 00:05:14,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YASUSHI]
This isn't fair to Kanno!</b></font>

111
00:05:14,690 --> 00:05:16,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Who cares?</b></font>

112
00:05:16,150 --> 00:05:17,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You protect one girl,
then the other.</b></font>

113
00:05:18,150 --> 00:05:20,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[gasps]
-Do you want Kanno or Ishimori?</b></font>

114
00:05:20,110 --> 00:05:21,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Make up your mind!</b></font>

115
00:05:21,490 --> 00:05:23,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Nah. Seems clear to me.</b></font>

116
00:05:24,570 --> 00:05:27,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>There's only been one
he's really trying to protect.</b></font>

117
00:05:27,540 --> 00:05:29,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Though he's still managed
to find a way</b></font>

118
00:05:29,910 --> 00:05:31,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to give them both
the wrong idea.</b></font>

119
00:05:31,620 --> 00:05:34,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

120
00:05:34,250 --> 00:05:35,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Look at that.</b></font>

121
00:05:35,960 --> 00:05:38,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's been a while
since I've seen the ocean.</b></font>

122
00:05:38,710 --> 00:05:40,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Not since my parents took me</b></font>

123
00:05:40,130 --> 00:05:41,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>my first year of junior high.</b></font>

124
00:05:43,430 --> 00:05:45,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I was too scared
of seeing people</b></font>

125
00:05:45,220 --> 00:05:46,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>from my school.</b></font>

126
00:05:46,760 --> 00:05:48,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Kept making excuses.</b></font>

127
00:05:48,720 --> 00:05:50,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And we stopped coming.</b></font>

128
00:05:51,020 --> 00:05:52,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Back then, I thought</b></font>

129
00:05:52,890 --> 00:05:55,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I would live my whole life
running from places like this.</b></font>

130
00:05:56,110 --> 00:05:57,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And everywhere else.</b></font>

131
00:05:58,020 --> 00:05:59,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[REMI] Ishimori?
-[gasps]</b></font>

132
00:06:00,690 --> 00:06:02,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[whimpering]
-Huh?</b></font>

133
00:06:02,240 --> 00:06:07,620
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

134
00:06:10,290 --> 00:06:11,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[shudders]</b></font>

135
00:06:12,500 --> 00:06:13,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Why the heck's she here?</b></font>

136
00:06:13,960 --> 00:06:15,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Last person I wanted to see</b></font>

137
00:06:15,540 --> 00:06:17,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>over summer break.</b></font>

138
00:06:17,090 --> 00:06:19,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Imagine seeing a girl
like that in a swimsuit!</b></font>

139
00:06:19,460 --> 00:06:20,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[REMI'S FRIEND 1A]
I'd barf.</b></font>

140
00:06:21,210 --> 00:06:23,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
And it's all happening again.</b></font>

141
00:06:23,550 --> 00:06:25,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Just like I thought.</b></font>

142
00:06:25,800 --> 00:06:27,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Honest.</b></font>

143
00:06:28,010 --> 00:06:29,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Caring.</b></font>

144
00:06:29,850 --> 00:06:31,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Courageous.</b></font>

145
00:06:31,930 --> 00:06:33,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
No more running.</b></font>

146
00:06:33,390 --> 00:06:34,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'll take the first step.</b></font>

147
00:06:35,270 --> 00:06:36,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Hey!
-Huh?</b></font>

148
00:06:37,860 --> 00:06:39,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Um. Hello there.</b></font>

149
00:06:39,900 --> 00:06:42,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Uh, how have you been?</b></font>

150
00:06:42,610 --> 00:06:43,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Huh?</b></font>

151
00:06:44,070 --> 00:06:45,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Dude, you think
we're friends after</b></font>

152
00:06:45,490 --> 00:06:46,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>what happened last time?</b></font>

153
00:06:46,740 --> 00:06:47,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hell, no.</b></font>

154
00:06:47,820 --> 00:06:49,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Let's go!</b></font>

155
00:06:49,120 --> 00:06:50,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA] [gasps]
Wait.</b></font>

156
00:06:50,950 --> 00:06:52,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Please hold on a second!</b></font>

157
00:06:52,370 --> 00:06:53,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What do you want, freak?</b></font>

158
00:06:54,000 --> 00:06:55,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Weirdo!
Get away from me!</b></font>

159
00:06:55,500 --> 00:06:57,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA] No.
I can't give up!</b></font>

160
00:06:57,380 --> 00:06:59,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I've changed
so much since then!</b></font>

161
00:06:59,250 --> 00:07:01,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You know, I don't remember</b></font>

162
00:07:01,170 --> 00:07:02,960
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>seeing you around school,
lately!</b></font>

163
00:07:03,420 --> 00:07:05,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Huh?
-[panting]</b></font>

164
00:07:05,430 --> 00:07:06,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[REMI]
'Cause I dropped out.</b></font>

165
00:07:07,930 --> 00:07:10,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Didn't feel comfortable
being around there with you.</b></font>

166
00:07:10,810 --> 00:07:12,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
I had no idea.</b></font>

167
00:07:13,100 --> 00:07:15,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I don't understand,
but I'm sorry.</b></font>

168
00:07:15,480 --> 00:07:16,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You got a problem?</b></font>

169
00:07:16,770 --> 00:07:18,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
No, I swear!</b></font>

170
00:07:18,770 --> 00:07:20,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What are you up to now?</b></font>

171
00:07:20,440 --> 00:07:21,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Nothin' much.</b></font>

172
00:07:21,820 --> 00:07:23,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Trying to enjoy my life.</b></font>

173
00:07:24,150 --> 00:07:25,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That sounds nice.</b></font>

174
00:07:25,780 --> 00:07:26,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MASASHI'S FRIEND 2A]
Who's that? Feels like</b></font>

175
00:07:26,950 --> 00:07:27,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I've seen her before.</b></font>

176
00:07:28,030 --> 00:07:30,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Oh. From Remi's class, huh?</b></font>

177
00:07:30,530 --> 00:07:32,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

178
00:07:32,120 --> 00:07:33,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>See you.</b></font>

179
00:07:34,200 --> 00:07:35,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Just stay calm.</b></font>

180
00:07:35,500 --> 00:07:36,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm okay.</b></font>

181
00:07:37,710 --> 00:07:39,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Wait, that means...</b></font>

182
00:07:40,210 --> 00:07:42,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Is Kai Miura here, too?</b></font>

183
00:07:43,920 --> 00:07:45,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Over there.
-[all gasp]</b></font>

184
00:07:45,550 --> 00:07:46,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Oh, crap.</b></font>

185
00:07:47,380 --> 00:07:49,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[REMI'S FRIEND 1A]
He still talks to you?</b></font>

186
00:07:50,010 --> 00:07:51,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[REMI]
Interesting.</b></font>

187
00:07:51,760 --> 00:07:53,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You're making things
happen, aren't you?</b></font>

188
00:07:53,930 --> 00:07:56,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Uh, yeah! Exactly!</b></font>

189
00:07:56,230 --> 00:07:57,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>'Kay, chill out.</b></font>

190
00:07:57,770 --> 00:07:59,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You're not quite the nuisance
you were before.</b></font>

191
00:07:59,980 --> 00:08:02,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Still, not like I give a damn.</b></font>

192
00:08:02,570 --> 00:08:04,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[chuckles]
-Why did that make you happy?</b></font>

193
00:08:04,690 --> 00:08:06,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[chuckles]</b></font>

194
00:08:06,110 --> 00:08:08,490
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[AYUMI] Whoa!
Did you guys see that?</b></font>

195
00:08:08,570 --> 00:08:10,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Aren't those the people</b></font>

196
00:08:10,120 --> 00:08:11,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>who used to bully her
back in junior high?</b></font>

197
00:08:11,990 --> 00:08:13,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[AYUMI] I was gonna
try to give her a hand,</b></font>

198
00:08:13,790 --> 00:08:15,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>but she's got it covered.</b></font>

199
00:08:15,450 --> 00:08:17,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YURU] Our girl's
killin' it out there.</b></font>

200
00:08:17,750 --> 00:08:19,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SERINA]
I'm impressed.</b></font>

201
00:08:19,420 --> 00:08:21,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I need to move on
from my past, too.</b></font>

202
00:08:22,000 --> 00:08:23,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Maybe today could be the day.</b></font>

203
00:08:24,840 --> 00:08:25,960
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Kai...
-[KAI] Serina.</b></font>

204
00:08:26,380 --> 00:08:27,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You got a sec?</b></font>

205
00:08:40,230 --> 00:08:42,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[waves crashing]</b></font>

206
00:08:42,560 --> 00:08:48,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

207
00:08:48,280 --> 00:08:50,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I already know
what you're planning to say.</b></font>

208
00:08:50,610 --> 00:08:52,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So do you mind if I go first?</b></font>

209
00:08:52,950 --> 00:08:54,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Honestly.</b></font>

210
00:08:54,620 --> 00:08:56,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I still never really
got over you, Kai.</b></font>

211
00:08:57,750 --> 00:08:59,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We both know how you are.</b></font>

212
00:08:59,750 --> 00:09:02,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's so impossible to tell
what you're thinking.</b></font>

213
00:09:02,750 --> 00:09:05,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That's why
I had gotten the wrong idea.</b></font>

214
00:09:05,920 --> 00:09:07,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The way you were acting
before break made me think</b></font>

215
00:09:08,010 --> 00:09:09,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>you still cared about me
as well.</b></font>

216
00:09:10,090 --> 00:09:11,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But I understand.</b></font>

217
00:09:11,970 --> 00:09:13,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You only did that
for Uka's sake.</b></font>

218
00:09:14,140 --> 00:09:15,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>To keep her out
of the crossfire.</b></font>

219
00:09:16,430 --> 00:09:17,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So before we leave,</b></font>

220
00:09:18,520 --> 00:09:21,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>can I ask you what I was
too scared to ask back then?</b></font>

221
00:09:21,190 --> 00:09:22,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

222
00:09:23,060 --> 00:09:24,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Kai.</b></font>

223
00:09:25,150 --> 00:09:27,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Did you ever have
feelings for me?</b></font>

224
00:09:27,110 --> 00:09:29,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

225
00:09:29,740 --> 00:09:31,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I loved you.</b></font>

226
00:09:31,150 --> 00:09:32,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

227
00:09:33,410 --> 00:09:35,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SERINA]
Kai...I need you.</b></font>

228
00:09:36,330 --> 00:09:38,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But, you don't need me.</b></font>

229
00:09:40,000 --> 00:09:43,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But after what you said,
I had to let you go.</b></font>

230
00:09:44,170 --> 00:09:45,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That's my answer.</b></font>

231
00:09:45,670 --> 00:09:48,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

232
00:09:48,250 --> 00:09:49,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yeah.</b></font>

233
00:09:50,130 --> 00:09:51,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I knew that, obviously!</b></font>

234
00:09:51,760 --> 00:09:53,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Ya silly!</b></font>

235
00:09:53,680 --> 00:09:55,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Well, I've gotta head home.</b></font>

236
00:09:55,430 --> 00:09:59,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

237
00:09:59,600 --> 00:10:00,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Goodbye.</b></font>

238
00:10:00,810 --> 00:10:01,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And thank you.</b></font>

239
00:10:02,020 --> 00:10:06,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

240
00:10:07,020 --> 00:10:08,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[whimpering]</b></font>

241
00:10:09,650 --> 00:10:11,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[sobs]</b></font>

242
00:10:11,190 --> 00:10:12,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[sniffles]</b></font>

243
00:10:12,900 --> 00:10:16,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

244
00:10:20,750 --> 00:10:22,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[ALL]
Ah.</b></font>

245
00:10:23,120 --> 00:10:24,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

246
00:10:24,330 --> 00:10:25,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[groans]</b></font>

247
00:10:25,710 --> 00:10:27,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YASUSHI]
So, uh...</b></font>

248
00:10:27,250 --> 00:10:28,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We're sorry, Serina.</b></font>

249
00:10:28,960 --> 00:10:30,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Uh. But still,
did he really have to be</b></font>

250
00:10:30,710 --> 00:10:32,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>so harsh with that last part?</b></font>

251
00:10:32,340 --> 00:10:33,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yes.</b></font>

252
00:10:34,130 --> 00:10:35,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Thanks to that.</b></font>

253
00:10:35,840 --> 00:10:37,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I can finally give up on him.</b></font>

254
00:10:37,600 --> 00:10:44,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

255
00:10:44,690 --> 00:10:45,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Uh?</b></font>

256
00:10:45,900 --> 00:10:52,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

257
00:10:55,570 --> 00:10:56,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So, you good now?</b></font>

258
00:10:59,080 --> 00:11:00,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Yasushi panting]</b></font>

259
00:11:00,660 --> 00:11:02,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YASUSHI] Bro! What the hell
are you thinking,</b></font>

260
00:11:02,540 --> 00:11:04,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>rejecting Kanno?</b></font>

261
00:11:04,910 --> 00:11:07,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What?
No way!</b></font>

262
00:11:07,290 --> 00:11:08,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
What?</b></font>

263
00:11:08,380 --> 00:11:10,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But why would he reject her?</b></font>

264
00:11:10,880 --> 00:11:12,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA] Miura.
What happened?</b></font>

265
00:11:12,960 --> 00:11:14,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Something that
isn't your business.</b></font>

266
00:11:14,760 --> 00:11:16,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yes, it is!</b></font>

267
00:11:16,890 --> 00:11:17,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It is.</b></font>

268
00:11:18,050 --> 00:11:19,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Maybe you're right.</b></font>

269
00:11:19,550 --> 00:11:20,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Still...</b></font>

270
00:11:20,930 --> 00:11:22,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>you can't choose
how other people feel.</b></font>

271
00:11:23,140 --> 00:11:24,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So let it be.</b></font>

272
00:11:25,100 --> 00:11:26,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Don't bother racking
your brain over it.</b></font>

273
00:11:27,060 --> 00:11:29,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

274
00:11:31,940 --> 00:11:33,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SERINA]
And, sent.</b></font>

275
00:11:33,440 --> 00:11:34,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>To Miura?</b></font>

276
00:11:34,650 --> 00:11:36,240
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Nah. To Uka.</b></font>

277
00:11:36,860 --> 00:11:38,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>She'd get worried
if I left without saying.</b></font>

278
00:11:39,740 --> 00:11:42,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Why has everything been
about Ishimori lately?</b></font>

279
00:11:42,410 --> 00:11:45,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Why would he pick her?
It doesn't make any sense!</b></font>

280
00:11:46,080 --> 00:11:47,960
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You'll get it
once you know her.</b></font>

281
00:11:48,040 --> 00:11:49,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MIHO]
I highly doubt that.</b></font>

282
00:11:49,750 --> 00:11:51,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[groans]</b></font>

283
00:11:52,420 --> 00:11:55,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>With him,
I had lost my strength.</b></font>

284
00:11:55,550 --> 00:11:56,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[phone vibrates]</b></font>

285
00:11:57,840 --> 00:12:00,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But in her case, she found it.</b></font>

286
00:12:01,890 --> 00:12:03,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>She went home?</b></font>

287
00:12:05,180 --> 00:12:06,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

288
00:12:06,980 --> 00:12:08,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[phone chimes]</b></font>

289
00:12:08,270 --> 00:12:10,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

290
00:12:12,270 --> 00:12:15,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Lemme respond
to Uka real...quick.</b></font>

291
00:12:17,860 --> 00:12:19,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[moans]</b></font>

292
00:12:20,910 --> 00:12:22,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Uh.</b></font>

293
00:12:22,280 --> 00:12:24,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

294
00:12:24,830 --> 00:12:26,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[chuckles]
-[gasps]</b></font>

295
00:12:26,620 --> 00:12:28,960
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What'd you say to make her
write that novel?</b></font>

296
00:12:29,040 --> 00:12:30,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SERINA]
Here.</b></font>

297
00:12:30,170 --> 00:12:31,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'll let you see for yourself.</b></font>

298
00:12:31,830 --> 00:12:34,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

299
00:12:34,550 --> 00:12:36,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Oh. That's it?</b></font>

300
00:12:36,090 --> 00:12:37,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[chuckles]
Yeah.</b></font>

301
00:12:37,630 --> 00:12:39,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>There's nothing else
for me to say!</b></font>

302
00:12:39,510 --> 00:12:40,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>She knows what it means.</b></font>

303
00:12:41,050 --> 00:12:43,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'M SO GLAD YOU'RE
THE OTHER MEMBER, UKA!</b></font>

304
00:12:43,180 --> 00:12:44,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
You're so sweet,</b></font>

305
00:12:45,220 --> 00:12:47,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>but I should say this to you.</b></font>

306
00:12:47,270 --> 00:12:51,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

307
00:12:54,730 --> 00:12:56,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[phone vibrates]</b></font>

308
00:12:56,230 --> 00:12:58,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Uh!
[chuckles]</b></font>

309
00:13:00,860 --> 00:13:02,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
It's from Ayumi!</b></font>

310
00:13:02,120 --> 00:13:02,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I FINALLY FINISHED MY HOMEWORK!
AM I A GOOD GIRL?</b></font>

311
00:13:03,030 --> 00:13:03,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>GIVE ME COMPLIMENTS!</b></font>

312
00:13:04,080 --> 00:13:05,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>She's always adorable.</b></font>

313
00:13:06,830 --> 00:13:08,620
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Right. I should reply.</b></font>

314
00:13:09,330 --> 00:13:11,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>GOOD GIRL!
Are we close enough for this?</b></font>

315
00:13:11,370 --> 00:13:12,960
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Well...let's try!</b></font>

316
00:13:13,040 --> 00:13:15,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

317
00:13:15,090 --> 00:13:16,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[phone vibrates]</b></font>

318
00:13:17,010 --> 00:13:17,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Ah.</b></font>

319
00:13:18,340 --> 00:13:20,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>YAY!!</b></font>

320
00:13:20,220 --> 00:13:21,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
I've gotten more comfortable</b></font>

321
00:13:21,430 --> 00:13:23,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>texting Ayumi and Serina.</b></font>

322
00:13:23,430 --> 00:13:25,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>They're both so different.</b></font>

323
00:13:25,640 --> 00:13:28,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But still, I feel like
I know them better now.</b></font>

324
00:13:29,850 --> 00:13:31,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Ayumi likes it
when you dote on her.</b></font>

325
00:13:33,350 --> 00:13:35,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Whereas
Serina is very involved.</b></font>

326
00:13:35,940 --> 00:13:38,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Honestly, I don't
quite understand</b></font>

327
00:13:38,650 --> 00:13:40,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>why she concerns herself
with stuff like this.</b></font>

328
00:13:40,900 --> 00:13:42,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

329
00:13:42,910 --> 00:13:45,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If I want his number,
I need to ask him.</b></font>

330
00:13:45,200 --> 00:13:46,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So we need to hang out.</b></font>

331
00:13:47,240 --> 00:13:48,490
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Easy, right?</b></font>

332
00:13:48,870 --> 00:13:51,960
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But how do I get him
to meet up with me?</b></font>

333
00:13:52,500 --> 00:13:54,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I could say I wanna
hang out to get his number.</b></font>

334
00:13:54,830 --> 00:13:56,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Straightforward.</b></font>

335
00:13:56,420 --> 00:13:58,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Though I don't see
how he benefits from that.</b></font>

336
00:13:58,760 --> 00:14:00,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I don't know.</b></font>

337
00:14:00,550 --> 00:14:02,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I haven't even asked
Ayumi or Serina to meet up yet.</b></font>

338
00:14:04,180 --> 00:14:06,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm so socially anxious.</b></font>

339
00:14:06,260 --> 00:14:07,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I can't remember.</b></font>

340
00:14:07,510 --> 00:14:09,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Was I always like this?</b></font>

341
00:14:09,140 --> 00:14:10,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Stop right there!</b></font>

342
00:14:10,390 --> 00:14:11,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Don't let the bad
thoughts win!</b></font>

343
00:14:11,810 --> 00:14:13,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I should go for a walk!</b></font>

344
00:14:13,190 --> 00:14:14,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

345
00:14:16,060 --> 00:14:18,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hey, are you going somewhere?</b></font>

346
00:14:19,530 --> 00:14:20,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The bookstore.</b></font>

347
00:14:21,070 --> 00:14:22,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA'S DAD]
If you want, I can take you.</b></font>

348
00:14:22,900 --> 00:14:24,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm all right.</b></font>

349
00:14:24,490 --> 00:14:26,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA'S DAD] Well, be sure
to take your phone.</b></font>

350
00:14:26,160 --> 00:14:27,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I've got it.</b></font>

351
00:14:27,370 --> 00:14:28,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yeah, of course.</b></font>

352
00:14:28,950 --> 00:14:30,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
See ya!</b></font>

353
00:14:30,500 --> 00:14:34,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[door opens and closes]
[insects chirping]</b></font>

354
00:14:35,000 --> 00:14:37,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Summer break's almost over.</b></font>

355
00:14:37,130 --> 00:14:39,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Huh?
-I wonder how Miura's doing.</b></font>

356
00:14:40,050 --> 00:14:42,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STUDENT 8E] Look at those
hot guys over there!</b></font>

357
00:14:42,090 --> 00:14:43,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>They're totally
checking us out.</b></font>

358
00:14:43,880 --> 00:14:45,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STUDENT 8G] Hey.
You should go talk to them!</b></font>

359
00:14:45,800 --> 00:14:48,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STUDENT 8E] The blonde guy
especially is such a snack.</b></font>

360
00:14:48,350 --> 00:14:50,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STUDENT 8F] Right?
He's like a celebrity.</b></font>

361
00:14:50,890 --> 00:14:53,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Leave it to Kai
to get girls lookin' our way!</b></font>

362
00:14:53,480 --> 00:14:54,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Easy to pick 'em up.</b></font>

363
00:14:55,020 --> 00:14:56,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Where's my food?</b></font>

364
00:14:56,350 --> 00:14:57,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STUDENT 8C]
Yeah, yeah, we know.</b></font>

365
00:14:57,860 --> 00:14:59,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[sighs]</b></font>

366
00:14:59,230 --> 00:15:00,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STUDENT 8A]
Back to school next week.</b></font>

367
00:15:00,570 --> 00:15:02,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STUDENT 8B]
Got anything left to do?</b></font>

368
00:15:02,280 --> 00:15:03,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[STUDENT 8A] Homework.
-[STUDENT 8B] I feel that.</b></font>

369
00:15:03,990 --> 00:15:06,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STUDENT 8C] You, Kai?
Any unfinished business?</b></font>

370
00:15:06,990 --> 00:15:08,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yeah.</b></font>

371
00:15:08,780 --> 00:15:10,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Huh?</b></font>

372
00:15:10,790 --> 00:15:12,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STUDENT 8A]
Dude, where are you going?</b></font>

373
00:15:12,450 --> 00:15:13,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STUDENT 8C]
We're not done here!</b></font>

374
00:15:14,750 --> 00:15:16,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hey.</b></font>

375
00:15:16,120 --> 00:15:17,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I heard that
he rejected Serina.</b></font>

376
00:15:17,920 --> 00:15:19,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What?
Who'd do that?</b></font>

377
00:15:19,840 --> 00:15:21,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Guys like Kai.</b></font>

378
00:15:21,340 --> 00:15:23,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Wonder if he has his sights
on someone else.</b></font>

379
00:15:24,340 --> 00:15:25,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Oh.</b></font>

380
00:15:25,680 --> 00:15:27,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>There it is.</b></font>

381
00:15:27,220 --> 00:15:29,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Mom said she wanted
to pick up this book.</b></font>

382
00:15:29,430 --> 00:15:30,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

383
00:15:30,930 --> 00:15:32,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

384
00:15:32,180 --> 00:15:37,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

385
00:15:37,560 --> 00:15:40,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>"On the Arrangement
of Succulent Plants."</b></font>

386
00:15:40,400 --> 00:15:41,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hm.</b></font>

387
00:15:42,150 --> 00:15:43,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[chuckles]</b></font>

388
00:15:43,400 --> 00:15:44,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Not even a smile?</b></font>

389
00:15:46,700 --> 00:15:47,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
He's here.</b></font>

390
00:15:47,950 --> 00:15:49,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>With me!</b></font>

391
00:15:50,910 --> 00:15:52,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[ice clatters]</b></font>

392
00:15:52,700 --> 00:15:54,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
I can't believe it.</b></font>

393
00:15:54,370 --> 00:15:55,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm having drinks with him!</b></font>

394
00:15:57,250 --> 00:15:58,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Maybe it's been a while.</b></font>

395
00:15:59,210 --> 00:16:01,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Or maybe I missed him.</b></font>

396
00:16:01,130 --> 00:16:03,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But he looks even more
handsome than usual.</b></font>

397
00:16:04,300 --> 00:16:05,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

398
00:16:06,550 --> 00:16:07,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What?</b></font>

399
00:16:08,680 --> 00:16:10,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I apologize.</b></font>

400
00:16:10,800 --> 00:16:12,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI]
How are things?</b></font>

401
00:16:12,560 --> 00:16:14,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Good. And with you?</b></font>

402
00:16:14,600 --> 00:16:16,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[KAI] Good.
-That's good.</b></font>

403
00:16:16,730 --> 00:16:18,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI] Been looking
for a chance to ask.</b></font>

404
00:16:18,730 --> 00:16:21,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>How'd it go with those
three punks back at the beach?</b></font>

405
00:16:22,940 --> 00:16:24,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
You were watching?</b></font>

406
00:16:24,780 --> 00:16:27,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Well, I was just asking
how things had been.</b></font>

407
00:16:27,740 --> 00:16:29,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[KAI] Look at you.
-And then?</b></font>

408
00:16:29,780 --> 00:16:31,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I asked Remi
why I hadn't seen her at school</b></font>

409
00:16:31,990 --> 00:16:34,240
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and she said that
she dropped out a while ago!</b></font>

410
00:16:34,910 --> 00:16:36,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI]
Yeah.</b></font>

411
00:16:37,910 --> 00:16:39,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
You already knew?</b></font>

412
00:16:39,670 --> 00:16:41,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yeah.</b></font>

413
00:16:41,080 --> 00:16:43,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Swung by her class to see
if she felt bad,</b></font>

414
00:16:43,460 --> 00:16:44,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>but she wasn't there.</b></font>

415
00:16:44,960 --> 00:16:46,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I can hardly believe it.</b></font>

416
00:16:47,010 --> 00:16:48,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I had no idea.</b></font>

417
00:16:48,880 --> 00:16:50,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI]
That's right.</b></font>

418
00:16:50,470 --> 00:16:51,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The old you would've known.</b></font>

419
00:16:52,050 --> 00:16:53,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You would've been obsessed.</b></font>

420
00:16:53,800 --> 00:16:56,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You would be petrified
of what's gonna happen next.</b></font>

421
00:16:56,930 --> 00:16:58,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So it's great
you hadn't heard.</b></font>

422
00:16:58,940 --> 00:17:00,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Means you're moving on</b></font>

423
00:17:00,520 --> 00:17:02,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and your old bullies
can't bother you anymore.</b></font>

424
00:17:03,480 --> 00:17:05,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[REMI]
Still, not like I give a damn.</b></font>

425
00:17:06,320 --> 00:17:08,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
I guess the same goes for me.</b></font>

426
00:17:08,650 --> 00:17:10,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But actually...</b></font>

427
00:17:11,360 --> 00:17:13,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I've been like that
for a while.</b></font>

428
00:17:13,120 --> 00:17:15,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>They haven't bothered me
since junior high.</b></font>

429
00:17:15,790 --> 00:17:17,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>They haven't been around.</b></font>

430
00:17:17,250 --> 00:17:19,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
No. More than that.</b></font>

431
00:17:19,500 --> 00:17:21,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>All my attention's been on you</b></font>

432
00:17:21,420 --> 00:17:23,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and becoming a better me.</b></font>

433
00:17:24,750 --> 00:17:27,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[chuckles]
Yeah.</b></font>

434
00:17:27,510 --> 00:17:28,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Huh?</b></font>

435
00:17:29,050 --> 00:17:30,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Why does he look so happy?</b></font>

436
00:17:30,760 --> 00:17:33,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So, been hangin' out
with the girls?</b></font>

437
00:17:34,180 --> 00:17:36,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[UKA] Not yet.
-Any reason?</b></font>

438
00:17:36,430 --> 00:17:38,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'd like to find the chance,</b></font>

439
00:17:38,180 --> 00:17:39,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>but I'm still trying
to figure out</b></font>

440
00:17:39,890 --> 00:17:42,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>what they could stand
to gain hanging out with me.</b></font>

441
00:17:42,600 --> 00:17:43,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What?!</b></font>

442
00:17:43,980 --> 00:17:45,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm just afraid.</b></font>

443
00:17:45,400 --> 00:17:46,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If they're with me,
is that the most</b></font>

444
00:17:47,020 --> 00:17:48,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>valuable use of their time?</b></font>

445
00:17:49,110 --> 00:17:51,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
There I go again.</b></font>

446
00:17:51,820 --> 00:17:52,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Sure.</b></font>

447
00:17:52,950 --> 00:17:54,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Least it's valuable to me.</b></font>

448
00:17:54,410 --> 00:17:55,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

449
00:17:56,530 --> 00:17:58,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You're always
overthinking things.</b></font>

450
00:17:59,580 --> 00:18:01,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You're friends, aren't you?</b></font>

451
00:18:01,540 --> 00:18:03,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yeah!
That's a good point!</b></font>

452
00:18:04,250 --> 00:18:05,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[sighs]</b></font>

453
00:18:05,840 --> 00:18:07,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yo, Kai!
Ready to go?</b></font>

454
00:18:08,800 --> 00:18:10,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I didn't know
you were out with friends!</b></font>

455
00:18:10,800 --> 00:18:12,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Well...I'm off.</b></font>

456
00:18:13,550 --> 00:18:15,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hey. Make sure you finish that.</b></font>

457
00:18:15,970 --> 00:18:20,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

458
00:18:23,390 --> 00:18:25,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Wait! His number!</b></font>

459
00:18:25,480 --> 00:18:26,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If I don't get it now,
I might not</b></font>

460
00:18:27,020 --> 00:18:28,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>before the end of vacation!</b></font>

461
00:18:29,230 --> 00:18:30,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Hey, we found a girl.
-Ooh.</b></font>

462
00:18:30,740 --> 00:18:32,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You boys weren't
kidding about your friend!</b></font>

463
00:18:32,780 --> 00:18:34,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hey, gimme your number.</b></font>

464
00:18:34,700 --> 00:18:36,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[UKA] No.
-We can have fun.</b></font>

465
00:18:36,370 --> 00:18:37,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
I need to get it first!</b></font>

466
00:18:38,620 --> 00:18:40,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[STUDENT 8H] So?
-Miura!</b></font>

467
00:18:41,040 --> 00:18:43,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Please, can I get your number?</b></font>

468
00:18:43,120 --> 00:18:44,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

469
00:18:44,540 --> 00:18:45,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Who's this chick?</b></font>

470
00:18:45,710 --> 00:18:46,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Ugh.</b></font>

471
00:18:46,920 --> 00:18:48,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[insects chirping]</b></font>

472
00:18:48,250 --> 00:18:50,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[panting]</b></font>

473
00:18:50,550 --> 00:18:52,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You finally asked, eh?</b></font>

474
00:18:52,340 --> 00:18:53,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

475
00:18:53,470 --> 00:18:54,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's about time.</b></font>

476
00:18:55,300 --> 00:18:56,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Glad it's not just me.</b></font>

477
00:18:56,800 --> 00:18:58,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We both want to.</b></font>

478
00:18:58,600 --> 00:18:59,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

479
00:19:00,470 --> 00:19:01,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Go without me.</b></font>

480
00:19:02,180 --> 00:19:03,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yeah, yeah.</b></font>

481
00:19:03,640 --> 00:19:05,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Keep it real.
-[STUDENT 8H] Aw.</b></font>

482
00:19:05,270 --> 00:19:07,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

483
00:19:07,770 --> 00:19:08,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI]
Gimme your phone.</b></font>

484
00:19:08,770 --> 00:19:10,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Oh, right!</b></font>

485
00:19:10,520 --> 00:19:14,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

486
00:19:15,240 --> 00:19:17,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Ah. No, wait a second!</b></font>

487
00:19:17,450 --> 00:19:19,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

488
00:19:19,780 --> 00:19:21,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Did I mess up?</b></font>

489
00:19:21,160 --> 00:19:23,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[laughs]
-Maybe not?</b></font>

490
00:19:24,290 --> 00:19:25,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>On socials?</b></font>

491
00:19:25,830 --> 00:19:27,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
I mean, I know what they are.</b></font>

492
00:19:27,960 --> 00:19:30,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Wanna try?
Is this a smartphone?</b></font>

493
00:19:30,340 --> 00:19:31,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>A what?</b></font>

494
00:19:32,760 --> 00:19:34,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Maybe.</b></font>

495
00:19:34,470 --> 00:19:36,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I never actually had
a phone before high school.</b></font>

496
00:19:36,380 --> 00:19:37,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>My dad bought it.</b></font>

497
00:19:37,720 --> 00:19:39,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>No sweat.</b></font>

498
00:19:39,350 --> 00:19:40,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Let's just text for now.</b></font>

499
00:19:40,850 --> 00:19:42,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

500
00:19:42,640 --> 00:19:44,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>When you get home,
ask your dad</b></font>

501
00:19:44,350 --> 00:19:45,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>if you can download an app.</b></font>

502
00:19:45,680 --> 00:19:47,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

503
00:19:47,100 --> 00:19:49,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
He really gave me his number.</b></font>

504
00:19:49,110 --> 00:19:51,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI] I assume you won't text
till I text first.</b></font>

505
00:19:52,270 --> 00:19:53,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Nuh-uh!
-When?</b></font>

506
00:19:53,820 --> 00:19:57,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

507
00:19:57,200 --> 00:19:58,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
In case of emergency?</b></font>

508
00:19:59,620 --> 00:20:01,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That's fine.</b></font>

509
00:20:01,120 --> 00:20:03,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But you should
stand tall from now on.</b></font>

510
00:20:03,580 --> 00:20:05,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Be more fearless
than ever before.</b></font>

511
00:20:06,290 --> 00:20:07,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Okay?</b></font>

512
00:20:07,870 --> 00:20:09,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And whenever things
do go wrong, tell me.</b></font>

513
00:20:10,250 --> 00:20:11,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI]
I'll be there in a heartbeat.</b></font>

514
00:20:12,290 --> 00:20:13,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Sound good?</b></font>

515
00:20:13,500 --> 00:20:14,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yeah!</b></font>

516
00:20:17,800 --> 00:20:19,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA] [giggles]
It's slow.</b></font>

517
00:20:20,760 --> 00:20:24,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But steadily,
my world is changing.</b></font>

518
00:20:28,850 --> 00:20:30,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
I'm back!</b></font>

519
00:20:30,270 --> 00:20:31,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Welcome home.</b></font>

520
00:20:32,690 --> 00:20:34,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Well, you sure look happy,
don't you?</b></font>

521
00:20:35,030 --> 00:20:36,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yeah, I bumped
into a few friends</b></font>

522
00:20:36,740 --> 00:20:37,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>from my school there.</b></font>

523
00:20:38,030 --> 00:20:39,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA'S DAD]
That's great.</b></font>

524
00:20:39,530 --> 00:20:40,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So, uh...</b></font>

525
00:20:43,450 --> 00:20:46,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Hey, Dad?
-Welcome home, sweetie!</b></font>

526
00:20:46,790 --> 00:20:48,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If you were going out
shopping,</b></font>

527
00:20:48,370 --> 00:20:50,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>you should've asked
your dad to drive you.</b></font>

528
00:20:50,330 --> 00:20:51,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Those books must've been heavy!</b></font>

529
00:20:51,920 --> 00:20:53,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[chuckles]</b></font>

530
00:20:53,250 --> 00:20:54,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA'S DAD]
You know I offered.</b></font>

531
00:20:54,750 --> 00:20:56,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>She said no.</b></font>

532
00:20:56,210 --> 00:20:57,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Like how we can't take her
to the beach</b></font>

533
00:20:57,760 --> 00:20:59,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>or to see fireworks these days.</b></font>

534
00:20:59,800 --> 00:21:01,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But it's okay.</b></font>

535
00:21:01,300 --> 00:21:03,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You went with your friends
this year, right?</b></font>

536
00:21:03,300 --> 00:21:04,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That's wonderful.</b></font>

537
00:21:05,390 --> 00:21:07,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Although it makes me
a bit lonely.</b></font>

538
00:21:08,390 --> 00:21:11,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>At some point,
my little girl grew up</b></font>

539
00:21:11,350 --> 00:21:13,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and stopped
holding her dad's hand.</b></font>

540
00:21:13,770 --> 00:21:14,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA'S MOM]
Oh.</b></font>

541
00:21:17,070 --> 00:21:18,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Slowly...</b></font>

542
00:21:18,990 --> 00:21:20,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>but steadily.</b></font>

543
00:21:20,400 --> 00:21:21,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

544
00:21:21,780 --> 00:21:24,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>TO BE CONTINUED</b></font>

